---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base pageKey="privacy">
<main data-pad="" style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:100px 72px 120px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:34px">
  <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Legal</div>
  <h1 data-h1="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:52px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.05">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#A1A1AA">This page explains what information Create Studio collects through this website and how it is used. Final legal wording is pending review — sections below are marked where content must be supplied.</p>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.1)">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">Information we collect</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Details submitted through the project inquiry form: name, company, email, phone or WhatsApp, existing website, project type, selected package, budget range, timeline, project description and how you heard about Create Studio.</p></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">How we use it</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">To respond to your inquiry, prepare a proposal and communicate about a potential or active project. We do not sell or rent your information.</p></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">Analytics</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">[To supply — which analytics tool is used, what it measures and how visitors can opt out.]</p></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">Data retention</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">[To supply — how long inquiry data is kept.]</p></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">Third parties</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Hosting, email and analytics providers may process data on our behalf. [Provider list to supply.]</p></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">Your rights</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of the information you submitted by writing to lauzardo1991@gmail.com.</p></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px"><h2 data-h3="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600">Contact</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Oscar Lauzardo · +1 829.778.6137 · lauzardo1991@gmail.com · Santo Domingo, Dominican Republic.</p></div>
    <div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">Last updated: [date to supply]</div>
  </div>
<section data-slogan="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding:104px 72px 120px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;text-align:center">
  <p style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:54px;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.05;text-wrap:pretty">We Create. <span style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent">You Grow.</span></p>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
